4.SUM EXCEPT FIRST AND LAST 
You are given an array arr of numbers. Return the sum of all the elements except the first and last elements.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            int sumExceptFirstLast(int[] arr) {
                // your code here
                if(arr.length<=2){
                    return 0;
                }
                int sum=0;
                for(int i=1;i<arr.length-1;i++){
                    sum+=arr[i];
                }
                return sum;
            }
        }
